9
00:05:52.000 --> 00:06:25.000
But again, at the time, I didn't know I was doing anything weird. I thought that was normal. And I would bound up to people and say, oh, my goodness. I can't believe it. It's hit, hi, how are you doing? And they would just look at me blankly as I was a complete loon. And I would say, it's me, it's Kelly, and thinking, you know, they've clearly forgotten who I am and I'm a forgettable type of person. But I guess, I guess an example of the way a super recogniser works that illustrates it best is I was given the image of a known predator that we were looking for at a sporting event.

